{#-
  BLOCK: cta — §06's `cta`. The "View Full PDF" button, above the signature.

  The HTML is byte-for-byte what `_build_pdf_cta` emitted as an f-string; only
  the interpolation syntax changed. That is the whole intent of the
  consolidation — a restructure, not a redesign — and
  tests/test_email_render_diff.py holds it to that.

  VML first for Outlook, then the anchor for everyone else, both inside
  conditional comments. Outlook renders no CSS-styled anchor as a button, so the
  `v:roundrect` is not belt-and-braces; it is the only button Outlook shows.
-#}
            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin: 24px auto;">
